            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Set the waiting flock’s lane to birds, then send it to the island."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "把雞群等候的車道切換為「雞群」，再送牠們到安全島。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
